&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our full benefits &amp;amp; perks are explained in our handbook at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://remote.com/r/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://remote.com/r/benefits&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;remote.com/r/benefits&lt;/a&gt;. As a global company, each country works differently, but some benefits/perks are for all Remoters:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
